order: 111
---
short_label: X.111
---
sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: The apotome is not the same with the binomial straight line.
----
proof:

Let {AB} be an apotome.

I say that {AB} is not the same with the binomial straight line.

If possible, let it be so. Set out a rational straight line {DC}, and to {CD} apply the rectangle {CE|CEh} equal to the square on {AB} and producing {DE} as breadth.

Then, since {AB} is an apotome, {DE} is a first apotome. [!just X.97]

